{"name":"Aventurine","hex":"#576e6a","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"aventurine","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A kind of brownish glass containing gold-coloured spangles.","A variety of translucent quartz, spangled throughout with scales of yellow mica."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/aventurine"}],"entries":[{"title":"Aventurine","blocks":[{"text":"Aventurine is a form of quartzite, characterised by its translucency and the presence of platy mineral inclusions that give it a shimmering or glistening effect termed aventurescence."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Aventurine.jpg/330px-Aventurine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aventurine","wikidata":"Q429742"},{"title":"Aventurine (Honkai: Star Rail)","blocks":[{"text":"Aventurine, real name Kakavasha, is a character from the game Honkai: Star Rail, developed by miHoYo. In the game, he is one of the ten senior executives of the fictional organization known as the Interastral Peace Corporation (IPC). In the main storyline, he is tasked with reclaiming the IPC's control over the fictional planet Penacony. Over the course of the conflict, his cunning use of strategies allows him to manipulate the situation and secure leverage in negotiations, ultimately laying the groundwork for the IPC to seize corporate shares in Penacony, a planet in the game. Aventurine appears both as a playable character and as an antagonistic leader within the story, and his gameplay mechanic of randomly \"betting points\" reflects his gambler-like personality. He was released in version 2.1 of the game in March 2024."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/76/Aventurine_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aventurine_(Honkai%3A_Star_Rail)","wikidata":"Q129264006"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/AventurinGeschliffen.jpg/500px-AventurinGeschliffen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/AventurinGeschliffen.jpg/500px-AventurinGeschliffen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Aventurine","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAventurinGeschliffen.jpg"}],"sounds":{"aventurine":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/En-uk-aventurine.oga?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/En-uk-aventurine.oga/En-uk-aventurine.oga.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Amulet depicting a hawk, aventurine - Museo Egizio Turin C 989 p05","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Amulet_depicting_a_hawk%2C_aventurine_-_Museo_Egizio_Turin_C_989_p05.jpg/500px-Amulet_depicting_a_hawk%2C_aventurine_-_Museo_Egizio_Turin_C_989_p05.jpg","ratio":0.7066753288939418,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Amulet_depicting_a_hawk,_aventurine_-_Museo_Egizio_Turin_C_989_p05.jpg","share":0.73},{"title":"Amulet depicting a hawk, aventurine - Museo Egizio (Turin) C 989 p02","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Amulet_depicting_a_hawk%2C_aventurine_-_Museo_Egizio_%28Turin%29_C_989_p02.jpg/500px-Amulet_depicting_a_hawk%2C_aventurine_-_Museo_Egizio_%28Turin%29_C_989_p02.jpg","ratio":0.7398401632375446,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Amulet_depicting_a_hawk,_aventurine_-_Museo_Egizio_(Turin)_C_989_p02.jpg","share":0.725625},{"title":"Amulet depicting the heart, aventurine - Museo Egizio, Turin S 18329 p01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Amulet_depicting_the_heart%2C_aventurine_-_Museo_Egi